{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore a strange world trapped in a time loop, where your choices can change the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Cast spells, talk to curious creatures, and link branching timelines to unlock lost memories and find your way home. Murky blends lighthearted humor with introspective, emotional storytelling in a wholesome-ish puzzle adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890020/extras/c8a5d0b78804447abd432b198d97f47d.avif?t=1756908282\" width=798 height=104 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Solve puzzles with spells</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890020/extras/ff3687b546bd237bf683a3b8aa72c6e7.poster.avif?t=1756908282\" width=650 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890020/extras/ff3687b546bd237bf683a3b8aa72c6e7.webm?t=1756908282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890020/extras/ff3687b546bd237bf683a3b8aa72c6e7.mp4?t=1756908282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Trigger reactions  by understanding how each spell connects with the environment and the events around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890020/extras/4b0939183f43f64fdd22e90142e2801f.avif?t=1756908282\" width=837 height=104 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Loop through a 3 day cycle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890020/extras/e65c8126b0de4f055ac0e17904792790.poster.avif?t=1756908282\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890020/extras/e65c8126b0de4f055ac0e17904792790.webm?t=1756908282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890020/extras/e65c8126b0de4f055ac0e17904792790.mp4?t=1756908282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each character has their own needs, routines, and events. Discover their behavior across the 3-day cycle, and learn how to help them by solving their quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890020/extras/a3b9072a69ec4ae3335fa84e8ef08658.avif?t=1756908282\" width=859 height=119 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Jump between timelines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890020/extras/0d79f5da71366f1d8d4241b0ddad683e.poster.avif?t=1756908282\" width=780 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890020/extras/0d79f5da71366f1d8d4241b0ddad683e.webm?t=1756908282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890020/extras/0d79f5da71366f1d8d4241b0ddad683e.mp4?t=1756908282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Complete events (or leave them unfinished) to unlock new timelines, each with its own plots and events. Reveal fresh stories and other possibilities to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890020/extras/3006b0583108e8d8664d0b27d180949c.avif?t=1756908282\" width=869 height=105 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Recover your forgotten memories</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890020/extras/d254019cf9d00ccd0df6f2286bfb3c7f.poster.avif?t=1756908282\" width=780 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890020/extras/d254019cf9d00ccd0df6f2286bfb3c7f.webm?t=1756908282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890020/extras/d254019cf9d00ccd0df6f2286bfb3c7f.mp4?t=1756908282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As you explore and complete quests, you\u2019ll uncover fragments of your lost memories, clues to who you are, what happened, and why you\u2019ve ended up in this strange place.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3890020?t=1756908282","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890020/47